# Runway — environment variables
#
# Copy to `.env` (git-ignored) and fill in. Every variable the application
# reads MUST be listed here, even if only as a comment.
#
# As of the scaffold (issue #1) the application reads NO environment
# variables. `bun install && bun run dev` works with no .env file at all.
#
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Supabase — added by issue #2 (Supabase foundation + RLS). Not read by any
# code yet; uncomment together with the code that consumes them.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# NUXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=
# NUXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
# SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY=   # server-only. NEVER prefix with NUXT_PUBLIC_.
